// They make it to the side of the street.
# rat:ROCKY_KNEEL_HELP
# pigeon:PEGGY_SOFT_OPEN

"I could've died." #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP3

"Thank you so much for rescuing me." #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP2

"Can you move?" #speaker:Rocky

"Yeah... I think so. What is your name?" #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP1

"I'm Rocky. I'm a cook at my family's restaurant." #speaker:Rocky

"A rat restaurant?" #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP2

"Humans don't feed us." #speaker:Rocky

"So we feed each other." #speaker:Rocky

"That's actually really impressive." #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP2

"I've never worked a day in my life." #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP3

"I can't imagine doing that for hours." #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP3

"I'd pass out." #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP2

"Yeah. I figured." #speaker:Rocky

"My name is Peggy." #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP2

"Let me repay you. A date." #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP2

"A... date?" #speaker:Rocky

"I want to get to know you better." #speaker:Peggy #pigeon:PeggyP9

